type": "PrimitiveInt", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveInt"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 337, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [601.4135131835938, 401.40447998046875], "pos": [646.616455078125, -838.2743530273438], "id": 184, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 37}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [291], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 8], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 255, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscale_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale_by"}, "name": "scale_by", "label": "scale_by", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "scale_by"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ImageScaleBy", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [210, 82], "pos": [-1309.4215087890625, -500.140380859375], "id": 142, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.67", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleBy"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "OPT_CONNECTION", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [236.74765014648438, 92.20175170898438], "color": "#332922", "pos": [-1058.07666015625, -503.6951599121094], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 185, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "SeedVr", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【197 ImageCrop+ —— 末端居中裁切】\n\n作用：把「放大 + 拼接」的结果按成品规格居中裁切，输出精确尺寸，\n      全程纯裁切、不重采样（画质零损失）。\n\n  8704 × 15360 （输入 1088×1920 ×8 放大后）\n    ↓ 中心裁切（position=\"center\"，内部算 x=round((8704−7087)/2)=808\n                                              y=round((15360−14173)/2)=594）\n  7087 × 14173 （成品规格，1200×2400 cm @15dpi）\n\n接线：\n  125 拼接结果 → 197.image\n  190/191 成品尺寸 → 197.width / height\n  197 → 194（可选末端放大，默认 bypass）→ 178 压缩 → 182 保存\n  197 的 x / y 输出 → 186 / 187 显示（核对实际偏移）\n\n参数（comfyui_essentials 源码）：\n  image, width, height, position, x_offset, y_offset\n  九个 position：top-left / top-center / top-right / right-center /\n                 bottom-right / bottom-center / bottom-left / left-center / center\n\n要点：\n· 裁切在放大之后做，不需要在前端锁死像素\n· 想改成品尺寸只动 190/191，居中偏移自动算\n· width / height 会被 min(原图尺寸, 目标) 夹紧 —— 若拼接结果比成品还小，\n  不会报错，而是裁出「拼接尺寸本身」；此时调大 142 的 scale_by 即可\n· ⚠ 别用 ImageCrop（非 core 节点，各插件包入参顺序不一致，容易错位裁到空白区），\n  本工作流统一用 ImageCrop+\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "末端裁切说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [560, 300], "pos": [-288.7535705566406, 200.25936889648438], "id": 200, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["模型地址：\nhttps://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler\n\n型号：选择您的 DiT 型号\n\n3B 型号：速度更快，显存需求更低\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensorsFP8 8位（高质量）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.ggufGGUF 8 位量化（高质量）\n\n7B 型号：画质更高，显存需求更高\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensorsFP16（最佳质量）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors：FP8，最后一个数据块使用FP16，以减少伪影（质量良好）\n\nseedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.ggufGGUF 4 位量化（质量可接受）\nseedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_*：锐化版本，增强细节\n设备：用于 DiT 推理的 GPU 设备（例如，cuda:0）\n\noffload_device：当 DiT 模型不处于活跃处理状态时，用于卸载 DiT 模型的设备\n\nnone：将模型保存在推理设备（速度最快、显存最大的设备）上\ncpu：卸载到系统内存（减少显存）\ncuda:X：将负载转移到另一块GPU（如果可用，则可获得良好的负载均衡）\ncache_model：在工作流运行之间，保持卸载设备上的 DiT 模型加载状态\n\n适用于批量处理，避免重复加载\n需要设置 offload_device\nblocks_to_swap：块交换内存优化\n\n0：已禁用（默认）\n1-32：需要替换为 3B 型号的变压器模块数量\n1-36：需要更换为 7B 型号的变压器模块数量\n数值越高，节省的显存越多，但处理速度越慢。\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nswap_io_components：卸载输入/输出嵌入和归一化层\n\n结合 blocks_to_swap 可进一步节省 VRAM\n需要设置 offload_device 并且使其与 device 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [620.6390380859375, 641.826171875], "pos": [686.5722045898438, 226.84478759765625], "id": 183, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【放大 → 分块 → 拼接 → 裁切（显存调参指南）】\n\n尺寸链（尺寸由输入图决定，前端不锁死像素）：\n  输入图 →(142 × scale_by)→ 放大后尺寸 →(111 分块)→ 单块\n        →(143 ×0.25)→ 128 SeedVR2 →(144 回填)→ 125 拼接\n        →(197 ImageCrop+ 按 190/191 居中裁切)→ 成品尺寸 →(178 压缩)→ 182 保存\n\n① 放大倍率 —— 142 ImageScaleBy.scale_by（当前 8×）\n   演示源 1088×1920 ×8 = 8704×15360（拼接到这么大，再裁到成品规格）\n   想改放出尺寸就改这个倍率；成品尺寸另有 190/191 控制，两者独立\n\n② 分块数 —— 111 TTP_Tile_image_size 的 width_factor / height_factor\n   块尺寸 T = 放大后尺寸 ÷ (factor − overlap_rate×(factor−1))\n   8704×15360（8×）时：\n     3×3 → 3104×5480（17.0 Mpx，9 块）\n     4×4 → 2352×4144（ 9.7 Mpx，16 块）  ← 当前\n     5×5 → 1888×3336（ 6.3 Mpx，25 块）\n     6×6 → 1576×2792（ 4.4 Mpx，36 块）\n   分块数 ↑：每块更小（省显存）、块数 factor² 更多（更慢）、\n   每块各自拿一份 SeedVR2 细节（有效细节反而更高）\n\n③ 块输入压缩率 —— 143 ImageScaleBy.scale_by：0.25 标准 / 0.125 更省显存\n\n④ 块输出短边 —— 128 SeedVR2VideoUpscaler.resolution（当前 1024）\n   直接决定 DiT 显存（≈ 分辨率²）：768（8–10GB）/ 1024（12–16GB）/ 1536（24GB+）\n\n⑤ 块内 VAE —— 130 SeedVR2LoadVAEModel：encode/decode_tiled 已开，512/64\n⑥ 块内 DiT —— 129 SeedVR2LoadDiTModel：blocks_to_swap 32 + swap_io_components\n\n━━━ 显存档位推荐（8× 放大，即拼接尺寸 8704×15360）━━━\n| 显存    | 分块 | scale_by | resolution | VAE 分块 | BlockSwap    |\n| 8–10GB  | 5×5  | 0.125    | 768        | 512/64   | 32 + io 打开 |\n| 12–16GB | 4×4  | 0.25     | 1024       | 512/64   | 32 + io 打开 |\n| 24GB+   | 3×3  | 0.25     | 1536       | 1024/128 | 16–24 + io   |\n\n━━━ 显存实在不够：改用「先小后大」━━━\n  1) 把 142 的 scale_by 降到 4（拼接尺寸减半）\n  2) 把 194 ImageScaleBy 从 bypass 打开，scale_by = 2.0 补回尺寸\n  3) 190/191 改成缩小后的成品尺寸（如 3543×7087）\nSeedVR2 只在 1/4 的像素量上工作，最后一步 lanczos 纯插值补回。\n⚠ 197 裁切始终按 190/191 的成品尺寸执行，改规格只改这两个数\n   （居中偏移由 198/199 两个 ComfyMathExpression 自动算，不用手填 x/y）\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "显存调参指南（放大→分块→拼接→裁切）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [900, 1180], "pos": [-2271.745361328125, -1785.174560546875], "id": 192, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#234", "widgets_values": ["【尺寸 / 裁切 在哪调？】\n\n放大尺寸（由输入决定，非固定）：\n  142 ImageScaleBy 的 scale_by —— 当前 8×\n  输入 1088×1920 ×8 → 拼接到 8704×15360\n\n成品规格（裁切目标，改这里就行）：\n  190 PrimitiveInt「成品宽度」= 7087  ┐→ 197 ImageCrop+.width\n  191 PrimitiveInt「成品高度」= 14173 ┴→ 197 ImageCrop+.height\n\n197 的 position 选 \"center\"，居中偏移由节点内部算：\n      x = round((拼接宽 − 成品宽) / 2)\n      y = round((拼接高 − 成品高) / 2)\n\n所以：\n· 换成品规格 → 只改 190 / 191 两个数字，居中偏移自动跟随\n· 换输入图 / 倍率 → 拼接尺寸变了，偏移也自动重算，不需要手动填 x/y\n· 186 / 187 两个读数节点显示的正是 197 实际算出的 x / y（可用来核对）\n\n裁切位置：125 拼接之后、178 压缩之前（放大完成后再裁，纯裁切不重采样）\n\n⚠ position 九个可选值：top-left / top-center / top-right / right-center /\n  bottom-right / bottom-center / bottom-left / left-center / center\n  另外还有 x_offset / y_offset 可做微调（正负都可以）\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "尺寸 / 裁切 在哪调", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#356", "size": [560, 300], "pos": [-1348.29443359375, -1763.980712890625], "id": 195, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["分块数 ↔ 显存 / 细节\n\n块尺寸 = 放大后尺寸 ÷ (factor − 0.1×(factor−1))\n\nfactor ↑ → 每块更小（省显存）\n         → 块数 = factor²（更慢）\n         → 每块各拿一份 SeedVR2 细节（有效细节更高）\n\n当前 4×4；显存充裕用 3×3，吃紧用 5×5。\n（原作者注：建议不超过 4，5×5 属激进值，接缝风险略高，\n  靠 overlap_rate 与 Assy padding 融合）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "分块数公式", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [320, 210], "pos": [-1337.9066162109375, -1396.1854248046875], "id": 193, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [5025], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}, {"name": "CLIP", "links": [5027], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [270, 126], "pos": [-2443.536865234375, -460.16851806640625], "widgets_values": ["painting.safetensors", 0.6000000000000001, 1.0000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 5024, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 5026, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength_model"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_clip"}, "name": "strength_clip", "label": "strength_clip", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength_clip"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1018, "type": "LoraLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoader"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [5003, 5004], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-3499.124267578125, -459.20782470703125], "widgets_values": ["Armin Hofmann 风格，融合原研哉的东方极简美学与 Malika Favre 的矢量渐变人物抽象技法，超高清耳饰半面特写画面，极致纯正青银缠织渐变背景，东方诡魅神秘的南疆银饰巫女（银饰垂耳遮半颊，耳饰嵌蛊纹细刻），几何美学的夸张抽象半面解构变形，于深青暗域里银饰轻晃映眸，半影缠覆的诡魅特写视角，明暗极致反差的视觉张力，超顶级细节刻画，银饰蛊纹级精细暗纹，极致精致质感，C4D 极光光影立体渲染，矢量级平滑青银